aether3d is a from-scratch Aether and C rewrite. The Gopher3D Go sources were
used as the reference for the engine architecture, the renderer interface, the
GLSL programs, the PBR material and lighting model, the Gerstner-wave ocean, the
voxel and component systems, the OBJ/MTL loader's behaviour, and the demo scenes.
No Go code was copied.

